  "manual_side_effect_review": [
    "Jinxsprite selects the English branch once; hand/foot names are captured once, including chaos spawn RNG.",
    "Chain lightning captures the original hand name once; airstrike intensity/animation is calculated once.",
    "Polymorph threat candidates reuse the original single define_monster result.",
    "Charge animation is advanced once by fill_status_info; translated finite labels reuse that frame.",
    "Speech/TextDB Lua callbacks are not re-executed to obtain a translation.",
    "Search match/primary_sort, saved descriptions and canonical names stay English; translated rows use ephemeral display fields."
